# Cloudflare Workers + Static Assets routing for dynamic SPA routes.
#
# `not_found_handling: "single-page-application"` in wrangler.jsonc serves
# the root /index.html on any 404 — wrong for /trasy/<slug>/ and
# /szczyty/<slug>/, which need their per-route shell so useParams() can read
# the slug and TripDetailRoute / PeakDetailRoute can resolve the manifest.
#
# Build emits the shells under apps/web/out/trasy/_/index.html and
# apps/web/out/szczyty/_/index.html (placeholder slug from
# generateStaticParams). These rewrites point any direct URL under those
# prefixes at the right shell. The 200 status means rewrite (proxy), not
# 30x redirect — the URL bar keeps the real slug.
#
# Order: more-specific first. `_redirects` evaluates top-to-bottom; the
# first match wins, so we list both prefixes explicitly rather than a
# catch-all.

/trasy/*    /trasy/_/index.html    200
/szczyty/*  /szczyty/_/index.html  200
